<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink176-kilavi">
       talaimakaḷum tōḻiyum oruṅkuniṉṟuḻi ceṉṟatalaimakaṉ ivaḷ eṉṉai ivaikōṭaṟkuk kāraṇam eṉ eṉṟu tōḻaiyaiviṉāviyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
           Asked by the hero who went [over] when the heroine and the confidante were standing together to the confidante, saying 'What is the reason for her capturing of me?'</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink176">
<l>paṇpum pāyaluṅ koṇṭaṉa ṭoṇṭit</l>
<l>taṇkamaḻ putumalar nāṟu moṇṭoṭi</l>
<l>yaitamain takaṉṟa valkuṟ</l>
<l>koytaḷir mēṉi kūṟumati tavaṟē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>[The woman with] a body [like] a plucked bud,</l>
        <l>With bright bangles and wondrous, fitted, wide hips</l>
        <l>That are fragrant with new blossoms from Toṇṭi that are cool and fragrant,</l>
        Has taken my [good] nature and my bed [= my sleep].</l>
        Tell [me my] mistake!</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
